 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-fixer-a695",
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "draft_py": "# Drakuseth, Maw of Flames: \"Whenever Drakuseth attacks, Drakuseth deals 4 damage to any target and\n# 3 damage to each of up to two other targets.\"  The attack trigger (B2b-library-larcenist's event);\n# a Seq of two DEAL_DAMAGE atoms: Shock's \"any target\" slot, then Volcanic Salvo's \"each of up to\n# two\" slot (QAtMost 2) over \"any target\", with the \"another target\" mark IS_ANY_TARGET for \"other\n# targets\" (templates_b5c's distinct-target encoding; the engine widens it with the players). The\n# trigger designates each slot in turn (binding.TriggerBinder._designate_slots).\nany_target = FOr(\n    children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Planeswalker'),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Player'),\n    ),\n)\nattack = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=DeclareAttackersEvent(filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=4),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                    filter=any_target,\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n                'amount': QConst(value=3),\n                'target': Selector(\n                    count=QAtMost(n=2),\n                    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                    filter=FAnd(children=(FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ANY_TARGET), any_target)),\n                    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                ),\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [attack, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
